{"id": "q0467", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "aggressive", "audio_s": 2.46, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.147, "eot_read_ms": 18, "reference_answer": null, "query": "What are some cardio machines at the gym?", "transcript": "What are some cardio machines at the gym?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Sure! Some common cardio machines you'll find at the gym include treadmills, ellipticals, stationary bikes, stair climbers, and rowing machines. Each one helps improve your heart health and endurance in different ways.", "answer_ms": 887}
